      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Daniel from Leneva electrical is excellent to deal with and a no nonsense guy who knows his stuff (This is not the first solar system I have had). The system was installed within 2 weeks of confirmation once all the components were in place and he could schedule us in. The output from the system is brilliant and the way in which it has been setup will maximize the available sunlight all year round so I can't wait to see what it generates in the depths of winter. Step two will be the battery wall and going off grid for which Daniel has ensured we have the right equipment in place. I would highly recommend Daniel to anyone in our region considering solar.",
