      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Of the three companies who were recommended Leneva Electrical were the most responsive. This may be because they are fairly local. The system was ordered the day after the quotation was provided and installed about one week later.The installation appeared to be thorough and the system is quietly doing its thing on my roof. I would have no hesitation in recommending Leneva Electrical to other potential clients.I will find out how effective it is after receiving my first full bill in the future.",
