    {
      "review_id": "28370",
      "reviewer_name": "William",
      "reviewer_location": "VIC - 3685",
      "reviewer_state": "VIC",
      "reviewer_postcode": "3685",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2015-11-15",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "On initial contact Danny from Leneva suggested it would be best if he came to see our house and he could better advise us from there. Turned up when arranged [important] Danny did not try to oversell us with a system bigger than we needed and quite frankly no b/s. [ I had already had my head done in with technical jargon beyond my comprehension by other solar people] but with Danny he put it in simple terms of what and how and my wife and i could understand [refreshing]. We thought it would take weeks to happen but to our surprise within 6 days of first contact we were up and running with solar. Danny and his team were polite and professional and cleaned up after themselves, it would be great if all tradespeople took a leaf out of Leneva Electricals book. Our solar was connected at the end of September  and our September a/c without solar was $162 our October a/c with solar was $62, impressed, you bet. I think it is important to find somebody who will look at your situation first hand i dont believe you can get a proper quote over the phone. but to leneva 5 stars and would gladly give them a reference in short modern company old fashioned service so a big thank you to Danny and his crew and to Finn and his website and introduction to Leneva.",
